    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:21.167",
      "start": "00:02:17.167",
      "text": " ...a life-spent chasing tavern stories and myths."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:24.167",
      "start": "00:02:21.167",
      "text": " Sightings, eyewitness accounts,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:28.167",
      "start": "00:02:24.167",
      "text": " ...a hundred shipwrecks named and dated."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:33.167",
      "start": "00:02:28.167",
      "text": " Like you, Wolfhardt knew it was no storm or jagged rocks"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:37.167",
      "start": "00:02:33.167",
      "text": " ...that caused their demise."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:40.167",
      "start": "00:02:37.167",
      "text": " It was the tide maker,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:43.167",
      "start": "00:02:40.167",
      "text": " ...the islander,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:45.167",
      "start": "00:02:43.167",
      "text": " ...the islander,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:48.167",
      "start": "00:02:45.167",
      "text": " ...the ancient Merworm,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:02:53.167",
      "start": "00:02:48.167",
      "text": " ...the elves named it Ammonar."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:00.167",
      "start": "00:02:56.167",
      "text": " Wolfhardt's ship, where is it?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:04.167",
      "start": "00:03:00.167",
      "text": " Ah, yes, it's final resting place."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:08.167",
      "start": "00:03:04.167",
      "text": " It was here he fought the beast,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:11.167",
      "start": "00:03:08.167",
      "text": " ...a fighting to the death."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:20.167",
      "start": "00:03:16.167",
      "text": " But one of his crew was lost."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:25.167",
      "start": "00:03:20.167",
      "text": " It was he who marked the map with this cross."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:28.167",
      "start": "00:03:25.167",
      "text": " The vengeance lies here."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:31.167",
      "start": "00:03:28.167",
      "text": " And if the story runs true,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:33.167",
      "start": "00:03:31.167",
      "text": " ...a weapon lies with her,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:38.167",
      "start": "00:03:33.167",
      "text": " ...a weapon to kill the unkillable."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:44.167",
      "start": "00:03:39.167",
      "text": " To challenge the beast is to challenge the sea itself,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:49.167",
      "start": "00:03:44.167",
      "text": " ...cursing all that sail with its retribution."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:53.167",
      "start": "00:03:49.167",
      "text": " Wolfhardt sought it for me for killing the beast,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:56.167",
      "start": "00:03:53.167",
      "text": " ...but the question remains,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:03:59.167",
      "start": "00:03:56.167",
      "text": " ...why would your kind seek it?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:02.167",
      "start": "00:04:00.167",
      "text": " ...haha."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:10.167",
      "start": "00:04:06.167",
      "text": " ...why all these storms go up?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:13.167",
      "start": "00:04:10.167",
      "text": " ...yes, hands beast."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:16.167",
      "start": "00:04:13.167",
      "text": " ...no matter who me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:22.167",
      "start": "00:04:18.167",
      "text": " My lord, we have the map."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:24.167",
      "start": "00:04:22.167",
      "text": " What are your orders?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:27.167",
